'''Bun Bun Black''' (ブラックブンブン, ''Burakku Bun Bun'', '''Black Bun Bun''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]]/[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Teacher Bun Bun]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Bun Bun Black
