==Trivia==
*The Bun Bun Black in [[Crazed Yuki (Enemy)|Crazed Yuki & Cat]]'s attack animation has the same purple "[[Crazed Cats (origin)|Crazed]]" aura as Crazed Yuki herself.
*[[Metal Maiden Koneko (Uber Rare Cat)|Sonic Siren Koneko]] is protected by a security guard Bun Bun Black.
**Given Bun Bun Black's gargoyle-like appearance, this may be a reference to how gargoyles were believed to protect against evil.
*The "Love" in [[Don't Rush Love]] may be the same "love" from Bun Bun Black's description.
*Prior to [[Version 12.3 Update|version 12.3]], Bun Bun Black's [[Enemy Guide]] entry in the [[The Battle Cats|English Version]] did not include his traits.
*Prior to the Enemy Guide rework in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]], Bun Bun Black and [[Dark Cyclone]]'s traits in the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese Version]] were listed as [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] rather than Floating/Dark.
*Unlike the Dark trait, [[Gory Dark]], [[Dark Cyclone]] and [[Dark Wind]], Bun Bun Black did not have the "Black" in his name changed to "Dark" in BCEN [[Version 15.3 Update|15.3]], presumably to keep the alliteration.

